    <feedback>
      <Value Culture="en"><![CDATA[I have had the pleasure of working alongside Pradeep Vijay during various spiritual practices as well as being present during some of his spiritual teachings on a number of occasions. His heart-centered approach is a powerful magnet for many of his students, creating an environment where not only the right level of knowledge and wisdom is shared but also a genuine willingness to go the extra mile to support his students in their self development. ]]></Value>
